  "source_inconsistencies": [
    "Level 1 lists blending items only; no segmenting list is printed.",
    "Every level is scored out of 10 but the printed item lists are longer or shorter than 10 (26, 15, 31/33, 17, 10/11, 8/9, 6/5, 7/6) — consistent with the instruction to sample 10 items.",
    "Level 3: 'past' and 'bring' appear in segmenting but not blending; 'best', 'fast', 'pick' and 'small' appear in blending but not segmenting.",
    "Level 4: 'done' is listed twice in segmenting; 'give' twice in blending; 'gave' appears in blending only; the item 'l/i//ke' has a stray extra separator (read as l/i/ke).",
    "Level 5: 'g/i/ve/' and 'g/a/ve' look carried over from Level 4; 'good' is printed unsegmented; 'been' has no blending counterpart.",
    "Level 6: 'th/e/m' looks carried over from Level 2.",
    "Level 7: 'those' has no blending counterpart.",
    "Level 8: 'better' has no blending counterpart."
  ]
